[00:00.00]Hello everyone. Today, I want to talk about my future goals.|大家好。今天我想聊聊我未来的目标。
[00:04.44]I have many ideas about what I want to do in the next few years.|对于接下来几年要做什么，我有很多想法。
[00:08.82]First, I want to learn more about the world. I think knowledge is very important for everyone.|首先，我想更多地了解这个世界。我认为知识对每个人都非常重要。
[00:15.98]I plan to read more books and watch educational videos. Maybe I can learn a new language too.|我打算多读书、多看有教育意义的视频。也许我还能学一门新语言。
[00:22.78]I like languages because they help us communicate with people from different countries.|我喜欢语言，因为它们能帮我们和不同国家的人交流。
[00:28.58]Another goal is to travel.|另一个目标是旅行。
[00:31.00]I want to visit new places and meet new people.|我想去新的地方，认识新的人。
[00:34.22]I have never been overseas, but I hope to go to Europe one day.|我从没出过国，但希望有一天能去欧洲。
[00:38.74]I want to see famous cities like Paris and Rome.|我想看看巴黎、罗马这些著名的城市。
[00:42.42]I also want to try different foods and drinks.|我还想尝尝各种各样的食物和饮料。
[00:44.96]I love cooking, so maybe I can learn some new recipes while traveling.|我喜欢做饭，也许旅行途中能学几道新菜谱。
[00:49.70]I also want to help others.|我也想帮助别人。
[00:52.16]I think it's important to contribute to society.|我觉得为社会做点贡献很重要。
[00:56.08]Maybe I can volunteer at a local charity or help people in need.|也许我可以在当地的慈善机构做志愿者，或者帮助有需要的人。
[01:00.28]I believe that even small actions can make a big difference.|我相信即使是小小的行动，也能带来很大的不同。
[01:04.58]For example, I can help at a grocery store or teach children how to read.|比如，我可以在杂货店帮忙，或者教孩子们读书。
[01:09.84]In my free time, I want to continue doing things I enjoy.|空闲时间，我想继续做自己喜欢的事。
[01:14.10]I like playing board games with my friends and riding my bike in the countryside.|我喜欢和朋友玩桌游，也喜欢在乡间骑自行车。
[01:19.22]I also like swimming in the summer.|夏天我还喜欢游泳。
[01:22.08]It's a great way to stay healthy and relax.|这是保持健康和放松的好方式。
[01:25.22]I think it's important to have fun and not get too stressed about work or school.|我觉得开心很重要，不要为工作或学业太过紧张。
[01:30.44]I also want to improve my skills.|我还想提升自己的技能。
[01:33.12]I can take some online courses or go to a cooking class.|我可以上一些网课，或者去上烹饪课。
[01:37.32]Maybe I can learn how to make new dishes or become better at my job.|也许我能学会做新菜，或者在工作上更进一步。
[01:41.64]I think learning new things will help me grow as a person and make my life more interesting.|我觉得学习新东西能让我成长，也让生活更有意思。
[01:47.74]I hope to achieve these goals step by step.|我希望一步一步实现这些目标。
[01:50.98]I know it won't be easy, but I am confident I can do it.|我知道这不容易，但我有信心做到。
[01:54.58]I will work hard and never give up.|我会努力，绝不放弃。
[01:57.72]I believe that with determination and effort, anything is possible.|我相信只要有决心和努力，一切皆有可能。
